:''For more information about this Cat Unit, see [[GirlsMons]].''
'''Undead Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] by accessing [https://ponos.s3.amazonaws.com/information/appli/battlecats/news/girlsmons_charaget.html this URL], which can be found in-game at the bottom of the "豆知識" tab in the main help menu. It was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]] for BCJP and [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]] for all other versions. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]] for BCJP and 11.6 for all other versions increases its health and backswing length and gains the [[Soulstrike]] ability.

